# LEARNING: MVVM Directory Placeholder
# This directory is reserved for future MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel) architecture implementation.
# In MVVM:
# - ViewModels replace Controllers.
# - ViewModels hold state as `StateNotifier`, `ChangeNotifier`, or `Stream` (RxDart / Riverpod / Bloc).
# - Views observe the ViewModel without calling direct business functions.
